cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it."
title: "Domain-calibrated machine learning and structure-based virtual screening of natural products against HCC kinases"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible pipeline that screens a natural-product library for candidate
  inhibitors of three hepatocellular carcinoma receptor tyrosine kinases, gating
  every compound on a conformal applicability domain so that predictions are only
  claimed where the model is calibrated, with orthogonal structure-based
  validation.
authors:
